# Native sleep/wake and first-ship boarding from Terri's saved state.
COMMAND restore
TYPE TERRIFULL
KEY enter
ASSERT_LOCATION 139 d3
LABEL terri_restored
COMMAND wait
COMMAND west
COMMAND west
COMMAND wait until 02:00
LABEL night_wait
ANSWER N
LABEL stopped_waiting
COMMAND sleep
LABEL slept
COMMAND take all
COMMAND east
COMMAND north
COMMAND down
COMMAND south
COMMAND south
COMMAND south
COMMAND up
LABEL first_ship
COMMAND save
TYPE HANGARFULL
KEY enter
